WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:03.593
- Welcome to the future.

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:06.900
- It's Drew Barrymore

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.670
and we're so excited to
share the secret behind

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.768
how we can get so many
of our amazing guests

00:00:12.768 --> 00:00:16.520
into the CBS Broadcast
Center in New York City,

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.500
where we're filming the show,

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.152
even if they're in Los Angeles

00:00:21.152 --> 00:00:24.160
and can't travel to New York.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.515
See my friend Dr. Aliza Pressman.

00:00:26.515 --> 00:00:29.170
She's the one sitting with me

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.063
or is she?

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.600
That's right Dr. Aliza is in our LA studio

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.243
beaming into New York, like
something out of Star Trek.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:42.393
It's incredible.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:48.370
The cameras are controlled
by our New York control room.

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:51.280
So there's not even a camera operator

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.800
in the room with the guest.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.960
So when guests are looking
to get away from it all,

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.020
they can come join us in New York,

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.240
I mean, LA,

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.930
but really it's in New York,

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:06.200
even though they're in LA,

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.750
but they're kind of in New York.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:08.660
Oh, well, you know what?

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:09.518
You get it.

00:01:09.518 --> 00:01:12.101
(upbeat music)

